        "heading": "How does FY2027 to date compare with prior fiscal years?",
        "body": "FY2027 to date obligations are $153M. FY22 obligations were $8.6B, FY23 obligations were $7B, FY24 obligations were $7.2B, FY25 obligations were $9.3B, and FY26 obligations were $5.6B. Obligations fell 97.3% year over year."
      },
      {
        "heading": "Which agencies, vendors, and industries dominate spending in FY2027 to date?",
        "body": "The Department of Agriculture obligated $99.4M and the Department of Veterans Affairs obligated $38.5M. PEACHTREE LUMBER COMPANY, INC received $99.6M and KING STREET TECHNOLOGY PARTNERS, LLC received $6.2M. Logging is the largest industry with $99.6M and Other Computer Related Services is the second with $6.5M."
      }
    ]
